AOO (Audio Over OSC) — BSD-3-Clause LICENSE PLACEHOLDER

The actual upstream LICENSE file lands here as `LICENSE` (no
suffix) when the full AOO source tree is vendored under T2521-4.

This placeholder exists so the vendor directory carries a visible
license posture before the source pull. The expected text comes
verbatim from upstream's repo at https://git.iem.at/cm/aoo/-/blob/
master/LICENSE — BSD 3-Clause.

Until the real LICENSE lands, packagers MUST treat the AOO source
as unvendored: the CMake gate at juce-engine/CMakeLists.txt line
~270 checks for `vendor/aoo/CMakeLists.txt` (not LICENSE), so this
placeholder is informational only.

Filed under: T2521-8b (cycle 29, 2026-05-15).
